class LibraryMember{private static int counter=100;private final String memberNumber;LibraryMember(int l){memberNumber="LIB-"+(++counter);}void borrowBook(){}void borrowBook(String genre){borrowBook();}static boolean isValidRenewalCode(String c){return c!=null&&c.length()==4&&c.charAt(0)=='R'&&Character.isDigit(c.charAt(1))&&Character.isDigit(c.charAt(2))&&Character.isUpperCase(c.charAt(3));}static int getMembersEnrolled(){return counter-100;}}
class FacultyMember extends LibraryMember{FacultyMember(int l,String d){super(l);}}
public class Main{static String processNightlyAudit(LibraryMember[] ms){int p=0,n=0,f=0,r=0;for(LibraryMember m:ms){if(m==null){n++;continue;}p++;if(m instanceof FacultyMember)f++;else r++;}return p+" processed | "+n+" null skipped | "+f+" faculty | "+r+" regular";}public static void main(String[]a){}}